cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the dataset below."
type: software
title: "NSM-IDS-2026: production and analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Scripts to reproduce the NSM-IDS-2026 intrusion-detection dataset end to end in a
  fully isolated KVM/libvirt lab: testbed provisioning, attack orchestration with
  ground-truth logging, benign-traffic generation, packet/host-log capture
  (tcpdump/Zeek/Suricata/Wazuh), the PCAP -> CICFlowMeter -> CICIDS2017-schema labeling
  pipeline, and the technical-validation experiments (E1-E6).
